            "id": 1206612,
            "title": "大埔上然1房戶1.15萬租出",
            "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif\">利嘉閣地產大埔站分行聯席董事葉順文表示，該行團隊精英最新促成大埔上然 7 座中層 A3 室的二手租務成交個案，面積約 302 呎，採一房連開放式厨房間隔，外望山景。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif\">葉順文透露，新租客早前透過利嘉閣「真盤源」網獲代理安排參觀上述放盤。客人心儀屋苑全新入伙，會所設施極其豐富，加上單位視野開揚，配合方正實用的開則，空間感佳，極符合個人居住需求，遂決定以 11,500 元承租上址，折合實用面積呎租約 38.08 元屬市場合理水平。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif\">據悉，業主去年底以約388.8萬元一手購入上述單位，持貨約 1 年，現可享約 3.55 厘租金回報。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
